@startuml
|Player|
start
:Launch Triangular Games application;
|System|
:Initialize GUI (mouse/keyboard support);
:Load built-in games\n(constructing, transforming, marking);
:Scan for added games (plug-ins);
:Populate game selection list in GUI;

|Player|
:Select a game from GUI;
|System|
if (Selected game supports\n2 players?) then (yes)
  |Player|
  :Choose play mode\n(solo or vs another person);
else (no)
  |Player|
  :Play solo;
endif

|Player|
:Play game using GUI\n(mouse and/or keyboard);
|System|
:Execute game rules and update GUI;

if (Player exits game/application?) then (yes)
  :Close application;
  stop
else (no)
  |Player|
  :Return to game selection;
  |System|
  :Show updated game list;
  -> :Select a game from GUI;
endif
@enduml